COMP SUPERSCALAR (COMPSs)
=========================

Copyright 2002-2026 Barcelona Supercomputing Center (www.bsc.es)

COMP Superscalar (COMPSs) is a task-based programming model and runtime system designed to simplify the development and execution of applications on distributed computing infrastructures, including clusters, grids and cloud environments.


PROJECT OWNERSHIP AND DEVELOPMENT
---------------------------------

COMPSs is developed by the Workflows and Distributed Computing (WDC) Group, Department of Computer Science (CS), at the Barcelona Supercomputing Center (BSC).

Website: https://compss.bsc.es/

Source code: https://github.com/bsc-wdc/compss


